      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Entregador. Delibird carrega alimento durante todo o dia. Há histórias de pessoas perdidas que foram salvas pela comida que ele levava. Este Pokémon mantém suas provisões consigo aonde quer que vá e as arremessa contra o adversário quando é atacado.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/1</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Delibird não possui evoluções conhecidas.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Present</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Drill Peck</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acrobatics, Aerial Ace, Agility, Air Cutter, Air Slash, Assurance, Attract, Aurora Veil, Avalanche, Baton Pass, Blizzard, Body Slam, Bounce, Brave Bird, Brick Break, Brutal Swing, Chilling Water, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Drill Run, Dual Wingbeat, Endeavor, Endure, Facade, Feather Dance, Fling, Fly, Focus Punch, Foul Play, Frost Breath, Frustration, Giga Impact, Gunk Shot, Hail, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Beam, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Ice Spinner, Icicle Spear, Icy Wind, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Protect, Rain Dance, Recycle, Rest, Return, Reversal, Round, Seed Bomb, Signal Beam, Sky Attack, Sleep Talk, Snore, Snowscape, Spikes, Steel Wing, Substitute, Swagger, Swift, Tailwind, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Trailblaze, Triple Axel, Water Pulse, Weather Ball</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Aurora Beam, Aurora Veil, Bestow, Counter, Destiny Bond, Fake Out, Freeze-Dry, Future Sight, Ice Ball, Ice Punch, Ice Shard, Icy Wind, Memento, Quick Attack, Rapid Spin, Spikes, Splash</p>",
